<title>USA: Allegro New Media says 20 pct of jobs cut.</title>
<headline>Allegro New Media says 20 pct of jobs cut.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allegro New Media Inc said on Wednesday that it has reduced its employee count by about 20 percent.</p>
<p>Included in the consolidation were the operations of recently acquired subsidiaries Serif Inc and Serif (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not immediately available to say whether the company would be booking a charge for the reduction.</p>
</text>
